Output recordings/boot.gif

Require bootvine-boot-example

Set Shell bash
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1380
Set Height 980
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Monokai Vivid"
Set TypingSpeed 0
Set Framerate 10

Hide
Type "clear && bootvine-boot-example"
Enter
Show

Wait+Screen@60s /0 running\s+0 waiting/
Sleep 2s
Hide
